B9 hidden state
  rule: a bool or local-enum field assigned (= or op=), or an Option field assigned or filled (insert, replace, take, get_or_insert, get_or_insert_with), inside a &mut self method of the same type
  limits: syntactic: misses writes through aliases (let f = &mut self.f), mem::replace or swap, helper fns, other types' methods, type aliases of bool or Option, and enums from other crates
